@startsalt
' Screen: Persona List
' User Stories:
'   - As a test engineer, I can browse all personas to select one for a run
'   - As a test engineer, I can create a new persona from scratch
'   - As a test engineer, I can import a starter persona from the library
'   - As a test engineer, I can see tone tags and published versions at a glance

{
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Prompts | Rubrics | Personas | Runs | Settings
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Personas</b>
    ..
    Personas define simulated user types — tone, expectations, and scoring weights — applied during script execution.
  }
  ==
  {
    [+ New Persona] | [Import from Library] | " Search personas...         " | ^Any Tone Tag^
  }
  --
  {#
    <b>Name</b>              | <b>Slug</b>                  | <b>Tone Tag(s)</b>           | <b>Published Ver</b> | <b>Created</b>    | <b>Actions</b>
