    Confused Novice       | confused-novice            | confused, low-literacy  | v1               | 2026-03-22  | [View] [Edit] [...]
    Power User            | power-user                 | terse, expert           | v3               | 2026-04-05  | [View] [Edit] [...]
    Adversarial Prompter  | adversarial-prompter       | adversarial, probing    | —                | 2026-05-10  | [View] [Edit] [...]
  }
